sparklink (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * slkd: SparkLink D-Bus management daemon
  * slkconfig: CLI configuration tool
  * slctl: interactive control shell
  * slkmon: protocol analyzer
  * slkdump: frame dump utility
  * libsparklink: shared library with C FFI

 -- SparkLink Maintainers <sparklink@example.com>  Mon, 01 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0800
